stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unpaired
    
    Unpaired --> InitiatePairing: User initiates pairing
    
    InitiatePairing --> QRCodePairing: QR Code Method
    InitiatePairing --> NumericPairing: Numeric Code Method
    InitiatePairing --> ProximityPairing: Proximity Method
    
    QRCodePairing --> DisplayQR: Generate QR with:<br/>- Session ID<br/>- Public Key Hash<br/>- Expiry (5 min)
    DisplayQR --> WaitingForScan: Display on Device A
    
    NumericPairing --> DisplayCode: Generate 6-digit code
    DisplayCode --> WaitingForCode: Display on Device A<br/>Enter on Device B
    
    ProximityPairing --> BroadcastBeacon: Broadcast BLE/NFC beacon
    BroadcastBeacon --> WaitingForProximity: Detect nearby device
    
    WaitingForScan --> VerifyQR: Device B scans QR
    WaitingForCode --> VerifyCode: Device B enters code
    WaitingForProximity --> VerifyProximity: Devices in proximity
    
    VerifyQR --> ExchangeCertificates
    VerifyCode --> ExchangeCertificates
    VerifyProximity --> ExchangeCertificates
    
    ExchangeCertificates --> ValidateCertificates: Exchange X.509 certificates<br/>and public keys
    
    ValidateCertificates --> EstablishTrust: Verify certificate chain<br/>Check revocation status
    ValidateCertificates --> PairingFailed: Invalid certificate
    
    EstablishTrust --> CreateDeviceGroup: Add to trusted devices<br/>Set trust level: VERIFIED
    
    CreateDeviceGroup --> GenerateGroupKey: Create or join group<br/>Generate shared group key
    
    GenerateGroupKey --> PairingComplete: Devices paired<br/>Can share via cloud
    
    PairingComplete --> [*]
    
    PairingFailed --> Unpaired: Retry pairing
    
    WaitingForScan --> SessionTimeout: 5 minutes elapsed
    WaitingForCode --> SessionTimeout: 2 minutes elapsed
    WaitingForProximity --> SessionTimeout: 1 minute elapsed
    
    SessionTimeout --> PairingFailed